Bar: a Tailscale status icon and popout

Tailscale's mark in the bar's status icons (taking no space until Tailscale
is installed), and a popout like the network one: on and off, this computer
and the tailnet's online devices (click one to copy its IP; a button sends
files with Taildrop, through arashos-taildrop, to those that take them),
switching between accounts (Tailscale and a Headscale server), and exit
nodes. Signing in runs ArashOS's setup in a terminal (arashos-install-app
--setup tailscale). It reads the status every 30 s while connected, every
2 min otherwise, and not at all while Tailscale isn't installed:
arashos-install-app tells it (qs -c caelestia ipc call tailscale refresh),
with a check every 10 min besides. Modelled on Omarchy's Tailscale bar
widget (MIT).

--- a/modules/bar/components/status/TailscaleStatus.qml
